---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="DREAMSTATE® — ENTER THE DREAM">
<section class="drop-hero" aria-label="DREAMSTATE first drop">
  <div class="drop-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="drop-orbit orbit-two"></div>
  <div class="drop-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="drop-topline"><span>EST. IN ANOTHER REALITY</span><span>001 / INCOMING</span></div>
  <div class="drop-composition">
    <div class="drop-kicker">A NEW WORLD IS LOADING</div>
    <h1 class="drop-wordmark">DREAM<span>STATE</span><sup>®</sup></h1>
    <div class="drop-centerpiece"><div class="drop-halo"></div><img src="/jeans.svg" alt="Illustrative DS-001 jeans concept; final product photography coming soon" /><span class="orbit-label label-left">DS—001<br/>THE FIRST EXPERIMENT</span><span class="orbit-label label-right">NOT INTENDED<br/>FOR REALITY</span></div>
    <div class="drop-bottom"><p>RESTRICTED TO THOSE WHO DREAM DIFFERENTLY.</p><a href="/shop/ds-001" class="drop-cta">EXPLORE DROP 001 <span>↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="drop-footer"><span>UNISEX / DENIM / 001</span><span>SCROLL TO DISCOVER ↓</span></div>
</section>
<div class="ticker-strip"><div>✳ NOT INTENDED FOR REALITY &nbsp; ✳ DREAMSTATE® &nbsp; ✳ ENTER THE DREAM &nbsp; ✳ NOT INTENDED FOR REALITY &nbsp; ✳ DREAMSTATE® &nbsp; ✳ ENTER THE DREAM &nbsp;</div></div>
<section class="drop-section">
  <div class="drop-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">TRANSMISSION 001</span><h2>THE FIRST<br/><em>EXPERIMENT.</em></h2></div><p>One silhouette. No rules. The debut DREAMSTATE denim release is coming.</p></div>
  <div class="drop-editorial-grid">
    <a class="drop-editorial-art" href="/shop/ds-001"><span class="art-stamp">001 / DESIGN STUDY</span><div class="art-ring"></div><img src="/jeans.svg" alt="DS-001 design concept, not a product photo"/><span class="art-footnote">FINAL GARMENT PHOTOGRAPHY COMING SOON</span></a>
    <div class="drop-editorial-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE SILHOUETTE</span><h3>DS—001</h3><p>Relaxed bootcut denim. Built to move differently. Designed to exist outside the expected.</p><div class="drop-spec"><span>FIRST RELEASE</span><strong>COMING SOON</strong></div><div class="drop-spec"><span>SIZES</span><strong>XS — XL</strong></div><a class="drop-cta dark" href="/shop/ds-001">DISCOVER THE DENIM ↗</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="dream-manifesto"><span>THIS IS NOT A NORMAL CLOTHING BRAND.</span><h2>REALITY<br/>IS <i>OVERRATED.</i></h2><p>Not intended for reality. Made for wherever your mind goes next.</p><a href="/world">EXPLORE OUR WORLD ↗</a></section>
<section class="dream-waitlist" id="signup"><div class="waitlist-orb"></div><div class="waitlist-inner"><span class="eyebrow">ACCESS / 001</span><h2>DON'T MISS<br/>THE DROP.</h2><p>Be first to know when DREAMSTATE® goes live.</p><form id="signup-form"><input id="signup-email" type="email" required placeholder="YOUR EMAIL ADDRESS" aria-label="Email address"/><button type="submit">JOIN THE LIST ↗</button></form><div id="signup-message" role="status"></div><small>Email collection is not connected yet. This is a design preview.</small></div></section>
</Base>